         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Delegation object and returns one row per current Worker delegation. Current delegations are: \n1) part of a Request Delegation Change presently effective for the delegating worker.\n2) open-ended or possessing an end date later than the current date.\nIncludes only current delegations for workers in organizations and corresponding sub-organizations which the user manages or supports. Includes associated managers if Include Managers is chosen. Contains built-in prompts. This data source will show all current delegations for workers in the user's organizations.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "End Date; Begin Date; Delegating Worker; Supervisory Organization; Delegation Rules; Allowed Action; Part of Delegation Request; Delegate for Current Delegations; Specified Business Processes; For all Business Processes; Elapsed Number of Days; Retain Access to Delegated Tasks",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "End Date; Begin Date; Delegating Worker; Supervisory Organization; Delegation Rules; Allowed Action; Part of Delegation Request; Delegate for Current Delegations; Specified Business Processes; For all Business Processes; Elapsed Number of Days; Retain Access to Delegated Tasks",
         "Report_Name": "Current Delegations",
         "Report_Owner": "lmcneil / Logan McNeil",
         "Report_Type": "Advanced",
         "referenceID": "Current Delegations by Organization"
      },
