      {
         "Brief_Description": "View a list of employees on international assignments as of a specified date. Details include information about the international assignment such as host country business site, position, supervisory organization, manager, start date, expected end date and actual end date. Other information includes the home country business site and manager.\n\nRequired prompt: None\nOptional prompt: Effective as of Date",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary object and returns one row per worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. Includes all workers even workers to be hired in the future. Doesn't contain any built-in prompts. This data source can be used to build reports on all workers. Helpful Tips: 1) If the worker is hired in the future, all fields will be returned based on the effective date. 2) If no effective date is specified, the system will use the current date as the effective date. 3) If the effective date is less than the worker's hire date, no effective dated information (such as position information, compensation information and so on) will be returned. 4) If effective dated behavior is desired, use the All Active and Terminated Workers data source instead.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Worker; Supervisory Organization; International Assignments & Secondments As of Date; Location; All Position's Managers; Position's Manager; Work Space; Position - Filled; Assignment Type; Actual Assignment End Date; Expected Assignment End Date; Photo; International Assignment & Secondment or Additional Job Start Date; Country from Position Location; Country for Headcount; Home Position (As of Date)",
