      {
         "Brief_Description": "Column Heading Overrides, or aliases, cannot change from update to update for backward capability reasons. New columns can be added but prior ones cannot change.  In addition at least 3 RDs and XSLTs need to remain in synch.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Payroll Result as its primary business object and returns 1 row per payroll result. \nOnly includes results based on the parameters you enter. Example: All results in a payment printing run or a set of selected payroll results. \nPrompts you for these values to automatically filter the report results:\n- Payment Printing Run\n- Payroll Results Viewable by Worker (payroll results)\n- Triggered from UI Task (boolean)\nYou cannot use both the Payment Printing Run and Payroll Results Viewable by Worker parameters. If both parameters are selected, Workday uses Payroll Results Viewable by Worker .\nUse this data source in a custom report enabled as a web service to create:\n- A batch of print advices (payment printing run).\n- A payslip draft or copy (payroll results viewable by worker).",
