         "Brief_Description": "This report is used to view the number of Split Vacation days granted to workers based on the Paid Vacation days taken during the legal period (from May 1 to Oct 31). Those days are granted on November 1 and available until May 31 of the next year.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Employee as its primary business object and returns 1 row per employee. This data source will show all active workers, regardless of contextual security. Excludes terminated workers, future hires, and any workers on leave if the leave type is marked as Inactivate Worker.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "No of FRA Paid Vacations Requests Within Legal Period With 10 or More Consecutive Days; Evaluate FRA Split Vacation Days Accrued; Count FRA Paid Vacation Days Where Units Requested > 0 and Within Legal Period (May 1 to Oct 31); Employee; Remaining FRA Paid Vacation Days in Legal Period (May 1 to Oct 31); Time Off Entry; Time Off Requests; FRA Paid Vacation Consecutive Days Within Legal Period >= 10",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Units Requested this Coordinated Leave/Time Off; 20; 0; Time Off Types for Time Off Event; First Day of Last Calendar Year; Time Off Entry; Today; Time Off Entry; 5; 2; 10; Location Address - Country; 1; Time Off Details; Time Off End Date; Time Off Type for Time Off Entry; Employee; Time Off Date; Time Off Requests; Units; First Day of This Calendar Year",
