         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Supplier as its primary business object and returns 1 row per supplier and 1 row per contingent worker. Includes all suppliers and contingent workers, identified by the Is Supplier and Is Contingent Worker fields. This data source does not refresh in real time; expect data latency.",
