      {
         "Brief_Description": "This report includes a wide variety of personal data of workers.\nIndividuals (ie employees) have a right to be informed by an organization (ei their employer) whether or not is is processing personal data that relates to them and, if so, to be told:\n\n- What personal data it is being processed\n- Who, if anyone, the personal data is disclosed to\n\nEmployers are required to respond to an SAR by providing, in an intelligible form, copies of the personal data and any information about the sources of the data.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary object and returns one row per worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. For active workers, all fields are as of the current date or Effective Date, if specified. For terminated workers, all fields are always as of the last day of work. Does not contain any built-in prompts. This data source can be used to build reports for only active and terminated workers and not all workers. For better performance, use the Indexed Worker data source instead. To identify if a worker is active or terminated, use the Currently Active field. This field will return whether the worker is active as of the current date.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Succession Plan Candidates; National Identifiers; Status; City of Birth (Locale Sensitive); Date of Birth; Region of Birth (Locale Sensitive); Gender; Disabled; Religion; Other IDs; Date of Birth; Relationship; Passports; End Assignment Date; Licenses; Government Identifiers; Addresses; Military Service; Highest Degree; National Identifiers; Location; National Identifiers; Worker; End Date; Start Date; Company; Job Title; Emails; Other IDs; Uses Tobacco; Government Identifiers; Government Identifiers; Ethnicities (multiple allowed - locale sensitive); Union Member; Date of Birth; Email - Primary; Uses Tobacco; Gender; Global Person Names in Local Script; Additional Information; Degrees; Title; Military Statuses (Locale Sensitive); Emergency Contacts; Dependents; Beneficiaries - People; Education; Certifications; Gender; Citizenship Status (Locale Sensitive); Email - Home; Last Medical Exam Date (Locale Sensitive); Last Medical Exam Comments (Locale Sensitive); Social Benefits Locality; Email - Work; Awards and Activities; Collective Agreement; Job History - Skills and Experience; City of Birth; Region of Birth; Country of Birth; Phone Numbers - Home; Primary Nationality (Do Not Use); Citizenship Statuses; Phone Numbers - Work; Marital Status; Workday Account; Date of Death; Development Items; Collective Agreement Effective Date; All Work Addresses; Global Person Names; All Home Addresses; Job History; Workday Account Sign Ons; Benefits Wellness Data; Disability Statuses; Instant Messenger; Phone Numbers; Visas; Primary Nationality (Locale Sensitive) (Do Not Use); Date of Death; Marital Status Date",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Succession Plan Candidates; National Identifiers; Status; City of Birth (Locale Sensitive); Date of Birth; Region of Birth (Locale Sensitive); Gender; Disabled; Religion; Other IDs; Relationship; Date of Birth; Passports; End Assignment Date; Licenses; Government Identifiers; Addresses; Military Service; Highest Degree; National Identifiers; Location; National Identifiers; Worker; End Date; Start Date; Company; Job Title; Emails; Other IDs; Uses Tobacco; Government Identifiers; Government Identifiers; Ethnicities (multiple allowed - locale sensitive); Union Member; Date of Birth; Email - Primary; Uses Tobacco; Gender; Global Person Names in Local Script; Additional Information; Degrees; Title; Military Statuses (Locale Sensitive); Emergency Contacts; Dependents; Beneficiaries - People; Education; Certifications; Citizenship Status (Locale Sensitive); Gender; Last Medical Exam Date (Locale Sensitive); Email - Home; Email - Work; Social Benefits Locality; Last Medical Exam Comments (Locale Sensitive); Awards and Activities; Collective Agreement; Job History - Skills and Experience; City of Birth; Region of Birth; Country of Birth; Phone Numbers - Home; Primary Nationality (Do Not Use); Citizenship Statuses; Phone Numbers - Work; Marital Status; Workday Account; Date of Death; Development Items; Collective Agreement Effective Date; All Work Addresses; Global Person Names; All Home Addresses; Job History; Workday Account Sign Ons; Benefits Wellness Data; Disability Statuses; Instant Messenger; Phone Numbers; Visas; Primary Nationality (Locale Sensitive) (Do Not Use); Date of Death; Marital Status Date",
         "Report_Name": "Subject Access Request (SAR)",
