      {
         "Brief_Description": "View all workers on leave within selected organizations, by leave type, and over a specified date range.  Leave one or both dates blank to perform an open-ended search. You also have the option to include workers returned from leave. Workday uses the Actual Last Day of Leave value (not the First Day Back to Work value) to determine whether workers have returned from leave. Details for each worker include leave type, leave dates, estimated total days on leave, and processing effects on other business areas. Enables you to perform related actions such as putting workers on leave or returning them from leave.\n\nRequired prompt: Organizations\nOptional prompts: Include Subordinate Organizations, Start Date, End Date, Include Workers Returned from Leave, Include Pending Events",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Leave of Absence Requests as its primary object.  The Leave Requests object returns one row per worker leave.  Includes all approved and pending (if Include Pending Events is true) worker leave requests where the actual last day of leave is not in the date range and the first day of leave is before the end date for organizations which the user manages or supports.  If the Include Workers Returned from Leave is checked on the leave requests returned will also include leave requests where the first day of leave is within the date range and the actual last day of leave is not considered.   Prompts the user at run-time for Organization, Include Subordinate, Include Pending Events, Date Ranges and Include Workers Returned from Leave to automatically filter the report results.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Position; Effect - Stock Vesting; Unit of Time for Leave Tracking; Effect - Continuous Service Accrual; Last Day of Leave - Actual; Workers as Leadership (including Manager); Effect - Absence Accrual; Leave Type (Including Family); Last Day of Leave - Estimated; Last Day of Work; Effective Date; Cost Centers; Worker; Total Days on Leave; Location; Hire Date; Effect - Benefits; Last Date for Which Paid; Supervisory Organization; HR Partner; Effect - Payroll; Units Requested for Current Leave; HR Business Partner",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Current Worker; Unit of Time for Leave Tracking; Organization and Subordinates; Hire Date; 3; Last Date for Which Paid; Organization Level from Top; Effect - Payroll; Supervisory Organization; Inactive; Top Supervisory Organizations Managed by Worker; Units Requested for Current Leave; Position; Effect - Stock Vesting; Workers as Leadership (including Manager); Last Day of Leave - Actual; Effect - Continuous Service Accrual; Effect - Absence Accrual; Leave Type (Including Family); Last Day of Leave - Estimated; Last Day of Work; Today; Effective Date; Cost Centers; Worker; Total Days on Leave; Location; Effect - Benefits; HR Partner; HR Business Partner; Today (System)",
         "Report_Name": "Workers on Leave - WD",
