      {
         "Brief_Description": "Best used in conjunction with the \"All Worker Bios\" report: \nStep 1: use the \"All Worker Bios\" report to identify the workers best suited for your demo using filters on desired fields. \nStep 2: run the \"Worker Bio Print for Selected Workers\" report, using the workers selected in step 1 and print the result into a 2 page long document per worker showing all their main characteristics in an \"easy to consume\" format.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary object and returns one row per worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. Includes all workers even workers to be hired in the future. Doesn't contain any built-in prompts. This data source can be used to build reports on all workers. Helpful Tips: 1) If the worker is hired in the future, all fields will be returned based on the effective date. 2) If no effective date is specified, the system will use the current date as the effective date. 3) If the effective date is less than the worker's hire date, no effective dated information (such as position information, compensation information and so on) will be returned. 4) If effective dated behavior is desired, use the All Active and Terminated Workers data source instead.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Job Title; Probation Periods; Age; All Talent Pools; Certifications; Worker's Manager; Languages; Position Succession Plan; Additional Jobs; Benefit Plans - Currently Enrolled; Gender; Professional Affiliations; Collective Agreement; Hire Date; All Eligible Time Off Plans for Worker; Last Base Pay Increase - Date; Supervisory Organization; Count All Dependents; Work Address - State/Province; Compensation Plans Effective; Photo; Demo Usage; Employee; Payroll Inputs with Optional Filters; Withholding Orders (Active); Job Interests; Unions Active; Race/Ethnicity (Locale Sensitive); Work Address - Country; Worker; Potential - Completed Rating; Company; Total Compensation in USD; Pay Group; Exempt; Number of Direct Reports; Employee ID; SA Demo Comments; Lookup Employee Contract End Date; Time Entry Template; Lookup Employee Contract Start Date; All Home Addresses - Full with Country; Lookup Employee Contract Type; Management Level; Work Schedule Calendars; Position ID; FTE; Employee Type; Succession Plans",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Primary Employee Contract; Age; Contract Type; Contract Start Date; Gender; Contract End Date; Last Base Pay Increase - Date; All Eligible Time Off Plans for Worker; Employee; Payroll Inputs with Optional Filters; Job Interests; Unions Active; Report Effective Date; Worker; Company; Position; Employee ID; SA Demo Comments; Work Schedule Calendars; Location Address - Country; Position ID; FTE; Employee Type; Succession Plan; Succession Plans; Job Title; Probation Periods; Dependents; All Talent Pools; Certifications; Worker's Manager; Languages; Benefit Plans - Currently Enrolled; Additional Jobs; Professional Affiliations; Collective Agreement; Total Rewards; Hire Date; Supervisory Organization; Work Address - State/Province; Time Entry Template; Compensation Plans Effective; Demo Usage; Photo; Withholding Orders (Active); Work Address - Country; Race/Ethnicity (Locale Sensitive); Is True; Worker Time Entry Templates; Potential - Completed Rating; Exempt; Pay Group; Number of Direct Reports; All Home Addresses - Full with Country; Management Level; USD",
