         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Time Type - Current; Effective Date for Position; Base Pay - Proposed; Location; Base Pay - Current; Primary Address - State/Province; Supervisory Organization; Effective Date of Last Compensation Change; Last Compensation Change (Base Pay - Current); Last Compensation Change (Base Pay - Amount Change); Total Base Pay - Frequency; Last Compensation Change (Time Type - Current); Last Compensation Change (Initiator); Total Base Pay - Amount; Manager - Level 01; Worker; Initiator; Company; Base Pay Proposed - Currency; Pay Group; Position; Effective Date; All Positions; Business Process Type; Primary Job; Base Pay Current - Amount; Location; Compensation History; Federal Withholding: FEIN; Location Address - Country; Last Compensation Change; Employee Compensation Business Process; Time Type",
