      {
         "Brief_Description": "Journal lines translated with eliminations.  Does not calculate current year retained earnings.  Includes prompts for time series start and end date for repeating column on period.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Journal Line as its primary object. A data source filter is required to be selected prior to running reports. The filters use Reporting Time Periods so that reports can be designed based on relative time spans.\nThe results will only include journal lines for journals that are in Posted or Proforma status, e.g. it automatically excludes journals that have been cancelled or are in error or draft status. This Data Source has the ability to create derived Journal Lines for financial reporting calculations similar to amounts reported by Trial Balance or Financial Statement. The derived journal lines can include system calculated amounts for currency translation gain or loss, Intercompany and Interworktag Eliminations and Eliminations Variance, and aggregated Current Year Retained Earnings.",
         "Data_Source_Filter": "Journal Lines for Company and Reporting Time Period",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Book Code; Fiscal Period Lookup; Ledger Account; Translated Debit Minus Credit Amount; Company",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Journal; Cost Center; Book Codes IN Book  for RDS Filter; Accounting Date; Cash Flow Code; Ledger Account; Customer Contract as Worktag; Transaction Currency; Book Codes Not In Book for RDS Filter; Intercompany Affiliate; Period; Journal Status; Translated Debit Minus Credit Amount; Company; Translated Debit Amount; Year; Translation Currency; Translated Credit Amount; Supplier as Worktag; Book Code; Sales Item; Pay Component; Job Profile; Division; Fiscal Period Lookup; Business Document; Campaign; Line of Business; Worktags; Location; Bank Account; Customer; Journal Source; Expense Item as Worktag; Worker; Project; Region; Books; Tax Authority; Spend Category as Worktag; Revenue Category",
         "Report_Name": "Sub Report - Journal Lines Translated - TTM2",
         "Report_Owner": "tserrano / Teresa Serrano",
         "Report_Type": "Matrix",
         "Used_in_Composite_Report_Definition": "Trial Balance by Book",
         "referenceID": "Journal Lines for Financial Reporting"
      },
      {
         "Brief_Description": "This report will show all contracts expiring in the next month and contracts with less than 10% remaining balance.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Supplier Contract as its primary business object and returns 1 row per supplier contract. Prompts you for Company or Company Hierarchy and filters by companies when prompts are left blank. This data source is indexed for optimized performance and refreshes in real time. To filter your report based on the Access Supplier Contract Type (Segmented) domain, use the Find Supplier Contracts Filter when creating your custom report.",
