      {
         "Brief_Description": "This custom report provides a list of Approved and Unpaid Supplier Invoice lines and amounts that are tagged as Business Asset applicable (depreciable and/or non depreciable).  Within France and maybe a few other countries in EMEA, there may be a need to classify these amounts into a separate liability ledger account during month end close financial reporting activities. The data provided from this report can be used to generate a journal to removes the current liability on unpaid invoices and reclassifies this into a separate payable-liability for assets during month end.",
