      {
         "Brief_Description": "Used to dump bio/demo data about all of the workers. Includes comments from the Solution Architect team about the best workers to demo. Best to dump this to excel and work with the data in there.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary object and returns one row per worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. Includes all workers even workers to be hired in the future. Doesn't contain any built-in prompts. This data source can be used to build reports on all workers. Helpful Tips: 1) If the worker is hired in the future, all fields will be returned based on the effective date. 2) If no effective date is specified, the system will use the current date as the effective date. 3) If the effective date is less than the worker's hire date, no effective dated information (such as position information, compensation information and so on) will be returned. 4) If effective dated behavior is desired, use the All Active and Terminated Workers data source instead.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Active Status; Age; Contract Pay Rate for Latest Contract (USD); Gender; Date of Birth; Primary Address - State/Province; Worker Type; Contract End Date; Last Base Pay Increase - Date; Worker; Current Contract Contingent Worker Event; Company; Employee ID; Time Entry Template; Work Schedule Calendars; Position ID; Is Active Employee; FTE; Job Title; Annual Base Pay / Contract Pay in USD; Dependents; Annual Pay / Contract Value (USD) Numeric; Cost Center; Certifications; Languages; Worker's Manager; Additional Jobs; Professional Affiliations; Number of Times Contracted; Hire Date; Supervisor Organization Manager; Supervisory Organization; Latest Contract Start Date; Contract Pay Rate for Latest Contract; Gender Text; Pay Frequency for Latest Contract; Race / Ethnicity Text; Is Top Performer; Contract Pay Rate Annualized; Full Name; Tenure Category Months Text; Work Address - State/Province; Currency for Latest Contract; Purchase Order from Latest Contract Text; Tenure Category (Months); Worker Type Text; Purchase Order from Latest Contract; Marital Status; Withholding Orders (Active); Supervisory Org Name; Has a Disability; Work Address - Country; Race/Ethnicity (Locale Sensitive); Work Address - City; Primary Work Address - Country; Annual Base Pay / Contract Pay in User's Preferred Currency; Total Compensation in USD; Exempt; Pay Group; Number of Direct Reports; Location; Management Level; Critical Job; Cost Center - ID; Worker Status",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "On Leave; Active Status; Length of Service in Months; Age; Contract Pay Rate for Latest Contract (USD); Gender; Job Profile; Date of Birth; Start Date; Primary Address - State/Province; Pay Frequency for Latest Contract; Termination Date; Currency for Latest Contract; Worker Type; Contract End Date; Last Base Pay Increase - Date; Contract Pay Rate for Latest Contract; 1; Contingent Worker; Worker; Report Effective Date; Users Preferred Currency; Company; Today; Business Process Type; Employee ID; Supervisory Manager; Disability (Locale Sensitive); Work Schedule Calendars; Staffing History - Approved; Position ID; FTE; Job Title; Dependents; 0; Currently Active; Annual Pay / Contract Value (USD) Numeric; Cost Center; Certifications; Name; Worker's Manager; Languages; Empty String; Total Base Pay for Multi Job Annualized - Amount; 12; Additional Jobs; Professional Affiliations; Total Rewards; Hire Date; Supervisory Organization; Supervisor Organization Manager; Latest Contract Start Date; Contract Pay Rate for Latest Contract; Gender Text; Race / Ethnicity Text; Pay Frequency for Latest Contract; Contract Pay Rate Annualized; Full Name; Tenure Category Months Text; Work Address - State/Province; Currency for Latest Contract; Purchase Order from Latest Contract Text; Time Entry Template; Tenure Category (Months); Worker Type Text; Withholding Orders (Active); Purchase Order from Latest Contract; Marital Status; Supervisory Org Name; Race/Ethnicity (Locale Sensitive); Work Address - Country; Work Address - City; Is True; Worker Time Entry Templates; Primary Work Address - Country; Active purchase order for contingent worker; Primary Termination Reason; Worker is Employee; Exempt; Pay Group; Worker is Contingent Worker; Effective Date; Number of Direct Reports; Location; Rating - Current; Management Level; Worker Active; USD; Cost Center - ID; Critical Job",
