         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Accounting Date - Year-Month; Journal; Summary Period Name; Ledger; Ledger/Budget Period; Fiscal Year; Period Name; Accounting Date; Period; Period Sequence Number; Year; Summary Period",
