      {
         "Brief_Description": "View a talent matrix that compares worker performance over time with potential in one or more organizations. Each box in the matrix classifies workers based on a different combination of performance rating and potential. Enables you to assess the long-term performance of an organization's talent relative to its potential.  \n\nRequired prompt: Organizations\nOptional prompt: Include Subordinate Organizations",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary business object and returns 1 row per Worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. For active Workers, all related objects are reported as of the current date. For terminated Workers, all related objects are reported as of their last day of work. For trending reports, use the Trended Workers data source instead.",
