      {
         "Brief_Description": "This transposed report enables managers and administrators to view a summary of headcount and management information for organizations in a selected org design.\nThe report returns 1 row per organization, transposed to appear as a separate column, and displays both current and proposed organization data.\nThe report uses the All Organizations in Org Design (Supervisory) report data source.\nRequired prompt: Org Design",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Organization as its primary business object and returns 1 row per Organization.  Only includes supervisory organizations that are included in the selected Org Design. Prompts you for Org Design to automatically filter the report results. Optional prompts available to further filter organizations returned: \na) Exclude Org Design Changes - to retrieve organizations based on current information (vs. including changes in Org Design).  This boolean impacts all of the prompts below. \nb) Use Level from Org Design - to determine organization level (used in conjunction with Starting Organization Level / Ending Organization Level)\nc) Starting Organization Level - to further filter organizations returned to those with a level equal to or lower than starting level specified  (i.e. if level 3 specified, return level 3, 4, 5, etc.)\nd) Ending Organization Level - to further filter organizations returned to those with a level equal to or higher than ending level specified (i.e. if level 3 specified, return level 3, 2, 1)\ne) Organizations - to further filter to a subset of selected organizations (if specified, these organizations are in addition to any included based on the Starting / Ending Organization Levels specified)\nf) Include Subordinate Orgs (used in conjunction with Organizations above) - if true, will also return all subordinate orgs for the specified organizations.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Position Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Position Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Filled Positions Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Unfilled Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Filled Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Unfilled Position Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Organization Change Types (Org Studio); Change in Percent of Unfilled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Percent of Filled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Count of Unfilled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Count of Filled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Count of Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Span of Control in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Change in Percent of Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Organization Level in Org Design (Org Studio); Manager Span of Control in Organization (Org Studio); Organization Level From Top (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Total Base Pay Variance (Org Studio); Organization Level from Top (Org Studio - Org Design if Approved); Supervisory Manager(s) (Org Studio); Sum Base Pay USD Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Supervisory Manager(s); Sum Base Pay USD Positions in Organization Current/Excluding Changes (Org Studio)",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Position Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Position Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Filled Positions Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Filled Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Unfilled Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Worker; Unfilled Position Count in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Organization Change Types (Org Studio); Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Position Count in Organization (Org Studio); Total Base Pay Annualized - Amount; Supervisory Manager(s) (Org Studio); Positions in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Report Effective Date; Change in Percent of Unfilled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Percent of Filled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Count of Unfilled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Count of Filled Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Change in Count of Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Span of Control in Organization (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Change in Percent of Positions in Organization (Org Studio); Manager Span of Control in Organization (Org Studio); Organization Level in Org Design (Org Studio); Organization Level From Top (Org Studio - Current/Excluding Changes); Organization Level from Top (Org Studio - Org Design if Approved); Position - Position Management; USD; Supervisory Organization; Supervisory Manager(s)",
