      {
         "Brief_Description": "This advanced report enables administrators to select a date range, transaction status, and staffing business process to view information about Contract Contingent Worker events. The report uses the Business Process Transactions report data source.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Action Event as its primary business object and returns business process transactions for all business process types.\n\nIncludes optional prompts for: Business Processes, Completed Date Range, Event Effective Date Range, Initiated Date Range, and Transaction Status.\n\nWorkday highly recommends that you use the Business Processes, Transaction Status, and date range (Initiated Date Range or Completed Date Range) as required prompts because this improves the performance of your report.\n\nThis report data source doesn't include outbound records for Staffing events that move workers from 1 organization to another. It only includes inbound records for this type of event.\n\nConsider using event report data sources for specific functional areas if you're trying to access data within those events. Example: A report navigates to data using calculated fields as a prompt or filter.\n\nIf you need to filter by or report on individual step details, use the Business Process Event Steps report data source.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Time Type - Proposed; Work Shift - Proposed; Default Weekly Hours - Proposed; Location - Proposed; Workers' Compensation Code - Proposed; Work Space - Proposed; Job Category; Instance; Effective Date; Employee/Contingent Worker Type - Proposed; Job Title - Proposed; Contract Contingent Worker Event; First Day of Work; Company Insider Types - Proposed; Job Profile - Proposed; Business Title - Proposed; Position - Proposed; Job Classifications - Proposed",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Time Type - Proposed; Work Shift - Proposed; Default Weekly Hours - Proposed; Location - Proposed; Workers' Compensation Code - Proposed; Work Space - Proposed; Job Category; Subject; Instance; Effective Date; Employee/Contingent Worker Type - Proposed; Job Title - Proposed; Contract Contingent Worker Event; First Day of Work; Company Insider Types - Proposed; Job Profile - Proposed; Business Title - Proposed; Position - Proposed; Job Classifications - Proposed",
         "Report_Name": "Contract Contingent Worker Event Details - Copy",
         "Report_Owner": "jbroqueza-trn / John Francis Broqueza",
         "Report_Type": "Advanced",
         "referenceID": "Business Process Transactions"
      },
