         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Worker; Postal Code; Address Line 2; Address Line 3; Address Line 1; All Home Addresses; Company; City; Worker's Manager; Legal Name; Employee ID; Location; Hire Date; Primary Work Phone; Worker's Matrix Manager; Phone - Primary Work; Primary Work Address",
