         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Location at Period End; Asset Share Worktags; Asset Cost (Transaction Date); Asset Cost (Accounting Date); Spend Category of Asset as of Period End; YTD Depreciation (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; YTD Depreciation (Posted) for Fiscal Period; Net Book Value (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Accumulated Depreciation (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Accumulated Depreciation (Posted/Accounted) for Fiscal Period; Net Book Value (Posted/Accounted) for Fiscal Period; Business Asset; Item Descriptor for RDS Filter; Accounting Treatment for Asset Book; Asset Disposed prior to Start Date of Fiscal Year; Company; Acquisition Method; Item; Asset Status; Missing in Asset Book; Worktags; Company or Company Hierarchy secured for Business Assets RDS Filter; Asset Share; Fiscal Period End Date; Spend Category for Net Book Value Report Data Source Filter; Book Currency; Date Acquired; Location from Custodian Activity; Custodian Activity as of Period End; Spend Category as Worktag",
