      {
         "Brief_Description": "This advanced report enables administrators to view all Workday-delivered reports and returns 1 row per report. The report excludes reports available only as a related action or reports that initiate a task. The report groups by category and displays details, including the description, domain, report type, and whether the report is schedulable. The report uses the Report Categories report data source.",
         "DS_Description": "Returns the categories associated with Workday-delivered reports. Prompts for one or more categories. If none are provided, all report categories are returned.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Domain; Category; Workday Reports; Schedulable; Name; Description; Report Type; UI Task",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Domain; Workday Reports; Category; Schedulable; Name; Description; Report Type; UI Task",
         "Report_Name": "Test",
         "Report_Owner": "hpurnima-trn / Purnima Hianl",
         "Report_Type": "Advanced",
         "referenceID": "Report Categories"
      },
      {
         "Brief_Description": "This advanced report enables award or billing specialists to view the supplier invoice revenue accrual for a company. The report uses the indexed Supplier Invoice Lines and Line Splits (Indexed) report data source, and returns 1 row per unsplit and split supplier invoice line. Required prompt: Company.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Supplier Invoice Line Distribution as its primary business object and returns 1 row per unsplit supplier invoice line and 1 row per supplier invoice line split. Includes all invoice lines, split and unsplit. Prompts you for 1 or more companies to automatically filter the report results based on the company at the line.",
         "Data_Source_Filter": "Supplier Invoice Lines and Splits for either Header or Line Company Filter",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Business Unit; Facilities And Administration Eligible; Grant; Fund; Facilities And Administration Percentage from Award; Document Payment Status; Supplier Invoice for Supplier Invoice Line Distribution; Award for Grant on Spend; Unpaid Direct Charge in Company Currency; Line Company; Instance; Award Revenue Recognition Amount from Award (Unpaid); Facilities And Administration Amount from Award (Unpaid)",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Business Unit; Facilities And Administration Eligible; Grant; Unpaid Direct Charge in Company Currency; Award Revenue Recognition Amount from Award (Unpaid); Instance; Facilities And Administration Amount from Award (Unpaid); Supplier Invoice Status; Company; Accounting Date; Supplier Invoice Line Type; Companies for Supplier Invoice Line Distribution Filter SQD; Fund; Supplier Invoice for Supplier Invoice Line Distribution; Facilities And Administration Percentage from Award; Document Payment Status; Award for Grant on Spend; Line Company",
         "Report_Name": "Supplier Invoice Revenue Accrual Report - Copy",
         "Report_Owner": "hpurnima-trn / Purnima Hianl",
         "Report_Type": "Advanced",
         "referenceID": "Supplier Invoice Lines and Line Splits (Indexed)"
      },
      {
         "Brief_Description": "This advanced report enables award or billing specialists to view the supplier invoice revenue accrual for a company. The report uses the indexed Supplier Invoice Lines and Line Splits (Indexed) report data source, and returns 1 row per unsplit and split supplier invoice line. Required prompt: Company.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Supplier Invoice Line Distribution as its primary business object and returns 1 row per unsplit supplier invoice line and 1 row per supplier invoice line split. Includes all invoice lines, split and unsplit. Prompts you for 1 or more companies to automatically filter the report results based on the company at the line.",
         "Data_Source_Filter": "Supplier Invoice Lines and Splits for either Header or Line Company Filter",
