      {
         "Brief_Description": "View asset cost, accumulated and year-to-date depreciation, and net book value for capital assets that have asset accounting assigned to them. Enables you to analyze accounting for all assets within a specified company/company hierarchy and ledger period. For asset cost, view amounts by accounting date and transaction date. For depreciation and net book value, view both posted and calculated amounts. View asset information, location, and worktags as of the period end date. Note that when assets are in status Pending Registration, not all data is available. \nIf a company hierarchy is selected and companies use a different schedule for the selected book, then results will be returned for companies where the selected book uses the fiscal schedule of the selected fiscal period.\n\nRequired prompts: Company, Period, Asset Book \nOptional prompts: Spend Category, Procurement Item, Accounting Treatment, Acquisition Method, Location (Period End Date)",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Business Assets as its primary object and returns 1 row per asset. Includes all business assets, including removed assets. Prompts you for Company, Spend Category, and Item to automatically filter the report results. If you don't include Asset Book, Workday reports from the company's primary asset book.",
         "Data_Source_Filter": "Business Assets for Net Book Value Report",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Asset Cost (Transaction Date); Asset Share Worktags; Company; Acquisition Method; Asset Cost (Accounting Date); Item; Asset Status; Asset Disposal (Gain) or Loss; Missing in Asset Book; Worktags; Spend Category of Asset as of Period End; Asset Class; YTD Depreciation (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Asset Share; YTD Depreciation (Posted) for Fiscal Period; Net Book Value (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Book Currency; Accumulated Depreciation (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Date Acquired; Accumulated Depreciation (Posted/Accounted) for Fiscal Period; Net Book Value (Posted/Accounted) for Fiscal Period; Location from Custodian Activity; Business Asset; Custodian Activity as of Period End; Accounting Treatment for Asset Book",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Asset Share Worktags; Asset Cost (Transaction Date); Asset Cost (Accounting Date); Spend Category of Asset as of Period End; Location at Period End; YTD Depreciation (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; YTD Depreciation (Posted) for Fiscal Period; Net Book Value (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Accumulated Depreciation (Calculated) for Fiscal Period; Accumulated Depreciation (Posted/Accounted) for Fiscal Period; Net Book Value (Posted/Accounted) for Fiscal Period; Business Asset; Item Descriptor for RDS Filter; Accounting Treatment for Asset Book; Company; Asset Disposed prior to Start Date of Fiscal Year; Acquisition Method; Item; Asset Status; Asset Disposal (Gain) or Loss; Missing in Asset Book; Worktags; Company or Company Hierarchy secured for Business Assets RDS Filter; Asset Class; Asset Share; Fiscal Period End Date; Book Currency; Spend Category for Net Book Value Report Data Source Filter; Date Acquired; Location from Custodian Activity; Custodian Activity as of Period End; Spend Category as Worktag",
         "Report_Name": "Assets Net Book Value - Copy - Test",
