         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "CF_snalla_GHPPRACTICE_FormatHire; Legal Last Name; Dependents; Primary Address - Formatted Line 2; Middle Name; Primary Address - Formatted Line 1; Legal First Name; Dependent; CF_snalla_GHPPRACTICE EE Worker Type; Gender; Date of Birth; Employee ID",
