         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Planning Staffing Status; Reference ID; To Be Hired ID; Supervisory Organization; Default Primary Compensation Basis - Currency; PLN - Hiring Restrictions - Location (Singular); Position and Job - All Staffing Models; Total Requisition Base Pay - Amount; Target Hire Date; Requisition Compensation Range - Currency; Dimension Reference ID for Adaptive Planning Integration; Worker; Open or Future Job Requisition; Earliest Hire Date; Bonus Plan Profile Target Percent; Current Position Filled - Effective Date; FTE (Staffing Interface); Position - Position Management; Compensation Basis Amount; Position Restriction; Publish Row ID; Position Vacated Date - Closed Positions; Plan Version ID for Adaptive Planning Integration",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Planning Staffing Status; Position Passes All Level and Dimension Filters for Roster Sheet; To Be Hired ID; Default Primary Compensation Basis - Currency; PLN - Hiring Restrictions - Location (Singular); Is Overlapped Position; Requisition Compensation Range - Currency; Worker; Bonus Plan Profile Target Percent; FTE (Staffing Interface); Compensation Basis Amount; Position Restriction; Is True; Reference ID; Supervisory Organization; Position and Job - All Staffing Models; Total Requisition Base Pay - Amount; Staffing Status; Target Hire Date; Dimension Reference ID for Adaptive Planning Integration; Primary Job; Earliest Hire Date; Open or Future Job Requisition; Current Position Filled - Effective Date; Hiring Restrictions - Location; Position - Position Management; Publish Row ID; Position Vacated Date - Closed Positions; Plan Version ID for Adaptive Planning Integration",
