         "Brief_Description": "View a summary of worker changes in one or more organizations. Enables you to analyze staffing and compensation changes by person within organizations. The work history includes current and proposed changes to positions, managers, cost centers, business sites, compensation grades, and base pay amounts.  \n\nRequired prompt: Organizations\nOptional prompts: Include Subordinate Organizations, Include Managers, Start Date, End Date",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Worker as its primary business object and returns 1 row per worker. Only includes active workers who are: 1) associated with the organizations selected, 2) associated with the corresponding subordinate organizations if Include Subordinate Organizations is selected, or 3) the manager associated with each supervisory and subordinate organization if Include Managers and 1 or more supervisory organizations are selected. Prompts you for Include Managers, Include Subordinate Organizations, and Organizations to automatically filter the report results.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Time Type - Proposed; Business Process Reason; Base Pay Change - Percent; Time Type - Current; Base Pay Change - Amount; Location - Proposed; Location - Current; Work Space - Proposed; Compensation Grade - Current; Gift - Proposed; Work Space - Current; Gift - Current; Compensation Grade - Proposed; Base Pay - Proposed; Base Pay - Current; Legal Name in General Display Format; Job Profile - Proposed; Job Profile - Current; Company - Proposed; Companies - Current; Job Code - Proposed; Current Manager(s) for Current Organization as of Effective Date; Job Code - Current; Current Manager(s) for Proposed Organization as of Effective Date; Effective Date; Business Process Type; Employee ID; Region - Proposed; Region - Current; Cost Center - Proposed; Cost Center - Current; Position - Current; Business Unit - Proposed; Program - Proposed; Grant - Proposed; Work History Summary; Fund - Proposed; Business Unit - Current; Program - Current; Grant - Current; Job Exempt - Proposed; Fund - Current; Job Exempt - Current; Position - Proposed",
