         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary business object and returns 1 row per Worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. For active Workers, all related objects are reported as of the current date. For terminated Workers, all related objects are reported as of their last day of work. For trending reports, use the Trended Workers data source instead.",
