         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Worker as its primary object and returns one row per worker. This data source will show all active and terminated workers, regardless of contextual security. For active workers, all fields are as of the current date or Effective Date, if specified. For terminated workers, all fields are always as of the last day of work. Does not contain any built-in prompts. This data source can be used to build reports for only active and terminated workers and not all workers. For better performance, use the Indexed Worker data source instead. To identify if a worker is active or terminated, use the Currently Active field. This field will return whether the worker is active as of the current date.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Base Pay Change - Percent; jcera-trn WICT CF ESI Most Recent Base Pay Change Event Greater Than 2%; Benefit Plans - Currently Enrolled; Total Base Pay Amount; Cost Centers Viewable by Everyone; Effective Date; jcera-trn WICT CF LRV Country ISO Code; Date of Birth; Employee ID; Location; Hire Date; Management Level; jcera-trn WICT CF EEB Comp Level; Business Title; Email - Primary Work or Primary Home; Average Headcount Last Year; Full Name; jcera-trn CF EMI Base Pay Change Events Greater Than 2%",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Base Pay Change - Percent; Is True; Report Effective Date; 31; 12; Benefit Plans - Currently Enrolled; Total Base Pay Amount; Effective Date; Cost Centers Viewable by Everyone; Date of Birth; Employee ID; Compensation History - Base Pay Changes Only; Location; Employee Count; Hire Date; Alpha-3 Code; Management Level; -1; Business Title; 2; Email - Primary Work or Primary Home; Location Address - Country; 1; Full Name; Total Base Pay Annualized in Reporting Currency - Amount",
