         "Brief_Description": "View all worker address changes before or after a specified date or within a date range. Enables you to assess any impact of address changes to business processes or external systems.  \n\nRequired prompt:  none\nOptional prompts: End Date, Start Date",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Contact Information Event business object and returns one Address Change Event per row. Contains built-in End Date and Start Date prompts.Includes any Address Change or Contact Information for Person Event. Does not include Address Add Events or Address Delete Events.This data source will deliver all Address change Events excluding Address Add or Delete Events.",
