         "Brief_Description": "View the number of job requisitions that have been open for under 30 days, 30 - 59 days, 60 - 89 days, and 90+ days based on the difference between the current date and recruiting start date. Required Prompts: Job Requisition Status. Optional Prompts: Hiring Manager, Supervisory Organization, Include sub organizations, Location, Recruiter, Multiple Openings.",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Job Requisition as its primary object and returns 1 row per job requisition. Includes all job requisitions and evergreen requisitions enabled with a completed Create Job Requisition Event. Prompts you for effective date and entry date to automatically filter results. \n\nAn indexed alternative to this data source is also available: Job Requisitions - Indexed, 1435$2245.",
