      {
         "DS_Description": "Accesses Organization as its primary business object and returns 1 row per Organization.  Only includes supervisory organizations that are included in the selected Org Design. Prompts you for Org Design to automatically filter the report results. Optional prompts available to further filter organizations returned: \na) Exclude Org Design Changes - to retrieve organizations based on current information (vs. including changes in Org Design).  This boolean impacts all of the prompts below. \nb) Use Level from Org Design - to determine organization level (used in conjunction with Starting Organization Level / Ending Organization Level)\nc) Starting Organization Level - to further filter organizations returned to those with a level equal to or lower than starting level specified  (i.e. if level 3 specified, return level 3, 4, 5, etc.)\nd) Ending Organization Level - to further filter organizations returned to those with a level equal to or higher than ending level specified (i.e. if level 3 specified, return level 3, 2, 1)\ne) Organizations - to further filter to a subset of selected organizations (if specified, these organizations are in addition to any included based on the Starting / Ending Organization Levels specified)\nf) Include Subordinate Orgs (used in conjunction with Organizations above) - if true, will also return all subordinate orgs for the specified organizations.",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Subordinate Organizations; Include Manager in Name; Direct Parent from Organization; Superior Organization Name",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Subordinate Organizations; Include Manager in Name; Direct Parent from Organization; Superior Organization Name",
         "Report_Name": "Test1234",
         "Report_Owner": "kpudari-trn / Keerthana Pudari",
         "Report_Type": "Advanced",
         "referenceID": "All Organizations in Org Design (Supervisory)"
      },
      {
         "Brief_Description": "View workers and their chain of command for one or more organizations.  Details include employee ID, name, title, job code, job profiles,  region, business site, company, cost center, worker's manager (level 1), manager's manager (level 2), up to level 10, if any. \n\nRequired prompt:  Organizations\nOptional prompts:  Include Subordinate Organizations, Include Managers",
