      {
         "Brief_Description": "Lists the budgeted expense amount by ledger account, cost center, region, spend category and company for the ledger accounts or summary selected. This report is used primarily as a sub report for composite reports with different control fields for the grouped by fields mentioned. It is also filtered based on orgs prompted, period, etc. This reports answers questions such as:\n\nWhat is my budgeted expense amount for a given time period, period by ledger account, region, product, revenue category and company?",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses all Plan Entry Lines and returns 1 row per Budget Entry Line. Prompts you for worktags to filter the report results.",
         "Data_Source_Filter": "Financial Plan Lines for Organization and Reporting Time Period",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Cost Center; Ledger Account; Region; Translated Debit Minus Credit Amount; Company; Spend Category as Worktag",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Supplier as Worktag; Book Code; Business Unit; Plan; Book Codes NOT IN Book for Plan Lines RDS Filter; Book Codes IN Book for Plan Lines RDS Filter; Plan Structure; Cost Center; Pay Component; Ledger Account; Today; Worktags; Location; Company or Company Hierarchy for Plan; Ledger/Budget Period; Plan Structure for Manager Plan to Actuals RDS Filter; Expense Item as Worktag; Project; Region; Translated Debit Minus Credit Amount; Company; Procurement Item; Spend Category as Worktag",
         "Report_Name": "Expense Budget Variance - Copy-Budget Expense by Ledger Account - Sub Report",
         "Report_Owner": "karma.chuki@accenture.com / Karma Chuki",
         "Report_Type": "Matrix",
         "Used_in_Composite_Report_Definition": "Expense Budget Variance - Copy",
         "referenceID": "Plan Lines for Financial Reporting"
      },
      {
         "Brief_Description": "Lists the expense actuals amount by ledger account, cost center, region, spend category and company for the ledger accounts or summary selected. This report is used primarily as a sub report for composite reports with different control fields for the grouped by fields mentioned. It is also filtered based on orgs prompted, period, etc. This reports answers questions such as:\n\nWhat is my actual expense amount for a given time period, period by ledger account, cost center, region, spend category and company?",
         "DS_Description": "Accesses the Journal Line as its primary object. A data source filter is required to be selected prior to running reports. The filters use Reporting Time Periods so that reports can be designed based on relative time spans.\nThe results will only include journal lines for journals that are in Posted or Proforma status, e.g. it automatically excludes journals that have been cancelled or are in error or draft status. This Data Source has the ability to create derived Journal Lines for financial reporting calculations similar to amounts reported by Trial Balance or Financial Statement. The derived journal lines can include system calculated amounts for currency translation gain or loss, Intercompany and Interworktag Eliminations and Eliminations Variance, and aggregated Current Year Retained Earnings.",
         "Data_Source_Filter": "Journal Lines for Organization and Reporting Time Period",
         "Fields_Displayed_on_Report": "Cost Center; Ledger Account; Region; Translated Debit Minus Credit Amount; Company; Spend Category as Worktag",
         "Fields_Referenced_in_Report": "Supplier as Worktag; Book Code; Business Unit; Journal; Cost Center; Pay Component; Book Codes IN Book  for RDS Filter; Ledger Account; Today; Worktags; Location; Book Codes Not In Book for RDS Filter; Ledger/Budget Period; Journal Source; Expense Item as Worktag; Project; Journal Status; Region; Translated Debit Minus Credit Amount; Company; Procurement Item; Spend Category as Worktag",
         "Report_Name": "Expense Budget Variance - Copy-Actual Expense by Ledger Account - Sub Report",
         "Report_Owner": "karma.chuki@accenture.com / Karma Chuki",
         "Report_Type": "Matrix",
         "Used_in_Composite_Report_Definition": "Expense Budget Variance - Copy",
         "referenceID": "Journal Lines for Financial Reporting"
      },
      {
